OL,4,CHorses highlight England's           W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,GAbout a five-minute walk from the    W5
OL,7,Gtrain station in Middlesbrough, six  W5
OL,8,Ghorses are grazing lazily on a       W5
OL,9,Gderelict patch of land.              W5
OL,10,                                      W5
OL,11,GTethered and friendly, the animals   W5
OL,12,Gdo not attract much attention from   W5
OL,13,Gresidents, despite being so close to W5
OL,14,Gthe town centre.                     W5
OL,15,                                      W5
OL,16,GBut their presence on the land, by   W5
OL,17,Gthe banks of the River Tees, is a    W5
OL,18,Gsymbol of the UK's decades-long      W5
OL,19,Gfailure to build enough houses.      W5
